WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.012
Today we will build and repeat a rhythmic pattern. Our work connects with Ghanaian

00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:06.387
and other African artists.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.824
Mark four beat spaces with dots on paper.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.249
Choose claps and thigh taps to fill the beat spaces. Record why your chosen technique

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:17.259
suits the message.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.997
Perform the pattern twice and check for a steady pulse.
